{"title":"粤港澳大湾区宣讲会要点","date":"2019-02-25","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体\">粤港澳大湾区宣讲会要点<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:120%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:120%;font-family:宋体\">日前，<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">《粤港澳大湾区发展规划纲要》宣讲会</span>，在香港正式召开。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:120%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:120%;font-family:宋体\">下面<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>具体看看宣讲会上有什么要点。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:120%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; line-height: 120%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201902/2.jpg\" style=\"width: 1080px; height: 466px;\" /><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;line-height:120%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:120%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-color=\"rgb(255, 129, 36)\">\r\n\t<section style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; position: static; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"line-height: 1.5em; border-width: 2px; border-style: solid; border-color: #ff8124; border-radius: 0.8em; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-left: 10px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: left; border-radius: 100%; background-color: #ff8124; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: #000000 1px 1px 3px 0px; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: right; border-radius: 100%; background-color: #ff8124; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: #000000 1px 1px 3px 0px; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"padding: 10px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"position: static; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 5px 10px; display: inline-block; font-size: 24px; color: #ff8124; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"clear: none; box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: 2px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;text-align:center;line-height:120%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑, 'Microsoft YaHei';\"><span style=\"line-height: 120%; letter-spacing: 1px;\">国家发改委副主任</span>-</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">林念修</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 120%;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;line-height:120%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"line-height: 120%; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #000000; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 20px;\">发展大湾区的契机:</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;text-indent:39px;line-height:120%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 120%; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">发展大湾区，有利于进一步推展港澳和内地双向开放，互补强强联合，对标世界一流湾区，</span><span style=\"line-height: 120%; letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong>为我国世界经济深度调整赢得一席之地，赢得主动。</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;text-indent: 39px;line-height: 120%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 120%; letter-spacing: 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">有利于高质量发展，利于市场活力迸发，</span><span style=\"line-height: 120%; letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">成为引领全国经济发展的重要动力源</span></strong><strong><span style=\"line-height: 120%;\">。</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;text-indent: 39px;line-height: 120%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"line-height: 120%; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #000000; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 20px;\">有利于解决面临的瓶颈问题，大湾区为解决这些问题提供了方案，为三地发展提供新的重大机遇。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 15px; padding-left: 10px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: left; border-radius: 100%; background-color: #ff8124; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: #000000 1px 1px 3px 0px; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: right; border-radius: 100%; background-color: #ff8124; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: #000000 1px 1px 3px 0px; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-color=\"rgb(255, 129, 36)\">\r\n\t<section style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; position: static; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"line-height: 1.5em; border-width: 2px; border-style: solid; border-color: #ff8124; border-radius: 0.8em; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-left: 10px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: left; border-radius: 100%; background-color: #ff8124; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: #000000 1px 1px 3px 0px; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: right; border-radius: 100%; background-color: #ff8124; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: #000000 1px 1px 3px 0px; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"padding: 10px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"position: static; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; padding: 5px 10px; display: inline-block; font-size: 24px; color: #ff8124; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"clear: none; box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: 2px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:10px;text-align:center;line-height:120%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\"><span style=\"line-height: 120%; letter-spacing: 1px;\">广东省省长</span>-</span>马兴瑞</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 120%;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 120%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"line-height: 120%; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #000000; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 20px;\">广东省如何参与与建设粤港澳大湾区？</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 120%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: #000000; line-height: 120%; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 20px;\">1、广东将抓住重大机遇，举全省之力推动大湾区建设。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 120%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: #000000; line-height: 120%; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\">2、目前广东省已经成立了由李希书记担任的广东省推进粤港澳大湾区领导小组。</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; line-height: 120%; font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\">近期将出台广东省贯彻落实规划纲要的实施意见与三年行动计划。</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 120%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"line-height: 120%; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #000000; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 20px;\">3、大力推动广州-深圳-香港-澳门创新走廊建设。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 120%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"line-height: 120%; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #000000; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 20px;\">4、加强推动港珠澳大桥、广深港高铁运营和管理，</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 120%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; line-height: 120%; font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #000000;\">5、</span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; line-height: 120%; font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: 1px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\">推动产业发展</span></strong>。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 120%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"line-height: 120%; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #000000; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 20px;\">6、和港澳共同建设全球科技创新高地，鼓励港澳青年到此创新创业。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 120%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"line-height: 120%; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #000000; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 20px;\">7、力争实现大湾区主要城市间1小时同通行。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:10px;line-height:120%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 15px; padding-left: 10px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: left; border-radius: 100%; background-color: #ff8124; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: #000000 1px 1px 3px 0px; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 0.5em; height: 0.5em; float: right; border-radius: 100%; background-color: #ff8124; box-sizing: border-box; box-shadow: #000000 1px 1px 3px 0px; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:120%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:120%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:120%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:120%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:120%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:120%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}